{"id":"u-e78cab63-984d-420b-92c7-2529f1dd701e","src":"community","title":"Chris Redfield Powerbuilding","author":"Leroy V.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/JXgHsc-chris-redfield-powerbuilding","desc":"The Chris Redfield Powerbuilding Program is a 4-day training system built to develop a thick, powerful, athletic physique inspired by Chris Redfield. The focus is on massive shoulders and arms, a dense chest and upper back, heavy traps, strong legs, powerful forearms, and a capable, conditioned body.\n\nEach training day begins with a major compound lift using the Redfield 4-Week Wave:\n\n- Week 1: 5×10 @ 60%\n- Week 2: 5×8 @ 70%\n- Week 3: 5×5 @ 75%\n- Week 4: 5×3 @ 80%\n\nBench press, rack pulls, back squats, and standing overhead presses provide the strength foundation. Once the full 4-week wave is successfully completed, increase the Training Max by 5 lb for upper-body lifts and 5–10 lb for lower-body lifts, then restart the wave at Week 1.\n\nHigh-volume accessory work builds the muscle and proportions that define the Redfield look. The split consists of Chest/Triceps/Abs, Back/Biceps/Grip, Legs/Abs, and Shoulders/Traps/Arms, with extra emphasis placed on delts, arms, chest, traps, upper-back thickness, and grip strength.\n\nThis program can be repeated continuously in 4-week waves, allowing strength and muscular development to progress together. Combined with proper nutrition and conditioning, the mission is simple: become bigger, stronger, leaner, and more capable while building a physique that looks ready for a biohazard outbreak.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-28T16:32:08.010Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60,"x":5}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":5}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":4